  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **My Sweet Blue Eyed Darlin** (1 review): Salt Creek was played immediately before this song, and the listener's corrected setlist adds it at the start [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **My Sweet Blue Eyed Darlin**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 5 archived performances [4]\n- **Who'll Rock The Cradle**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Dust In A Baggy**: earliest performance in the archive; rare: 10 archived performances [4]\n- **Where The Palm Trees Grow But The Pines Don't**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **Muddy Water Take My Pain Away**: rare: 9 archived performances [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **BS2015-07-12.MK4V** (recommended): source not stated; 10 songs; 60 min; rated 2/5 by 2 [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Track 9 is Albino Skunk, which the listener says is missing from the original setlist [3]\n- The corrected list also adds Red Rocking Chair after the opening pair and Meet Me at the Creek before Little Maggie [3]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **BS2015-07-12.MK4V**: taped by soling; transferred by soling; source: Schoeps MK4V (DIN-Windcutters) > KC5 > CMC6 > V3 > Sound Devices 744t@ 24bit/48hz [1]",
